      "content": "I understand your frustration, and I hear your concern about the implications of the language used; it was an unacceptable lapse in my professional judgment. While I cannot confirm the internal motivations behind the initial draft, I can definitively state that the final, corrected briefing will present the facts with the necessary nuance to protect our interests. My focus now is ensuring that the revised document not only reflects the MAS status but also provides a strategic pathway forward, which is what the Tan Group ultimately needs to see.",
